Related to Innovation
Entrepreneurship involves a continuous search for new
ideas. Entrepreneurship is innovative as it involves
introduction of new products, discovery of new
markets and sources of supply of inputs, technological
breakthroughs as well as introduction of newer
organisational forms for doing things better, cheaper,
faster and in a manner that causes the least harm to
the environment.
