Entrepreneurship • Organisation of Production
Production requires the combined utilisation of diverse
factors ofproduction, land, labour,capital and
technology.Entrepreneur mobilises these resources
into a productive enterprise or firm. An entrepreneur
may not possess any of these resources, but he may
just have the 'idea' that he promotes among the
resource providers.
